            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ehehe, thank you, Sensei! As I grow, I'll be able to plan even better festivals!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "I should still have room for improvement. For festivals' sake, and for Sensei's."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "It feels like I've taken a step forward. It's... a nice feeling."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_growup_4",
            "LocalizeJP": "どうですか、先生？ 私……成長しました？\nそれなら、嬉しいです……",
            "LocalizeEN": "Well, Sensei? Did I improve? ...Really? I'm glad to hear that!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "You know how, the day before a festival starts, your heart beats with anticipation? That's... how I feel right now. Ehehe..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "あの、先生？\n私は先生さえいらっしゃるなら……あの……その……\nど、どんなお祭りでも準備できそうです！\nはぁ……こんな言葉をいうつもりじゃなかったのに……",
            "LocalizeEN": "Um, Sensei? As long as I'm with you... um... well...! I... feel like I can organise any festival!\nOh... I... didn't mean to say that...!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "たまに、こんなことを考えます。\n先生と一緒なら、\n毎日がお祭りみたいなんじゃないかな、って……",
            "LocalizeEN": "Sometimes, I think about how, if I were with Sensei, every day would feel like a festival..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10090,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Umika_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0110/ch0110_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Um, Sensei? There's a lot I want to tell you, but... above all else... thank you so much. From the bottom of my heart."
        }
    ]
}
